# get_yugioh_card_info
**Type:** tool
**Module:** packages.haive-tools.src.haive.tools.toolkits.yugiioh_toolkit
**Class:** StructuredTool

## Description
Retrieve detailed Yu-Gi-Oh! card info using name, archetype, attribute, level, etc.

## Schema
```json
{
  "title": "GetCardInfoInput",
  "description": "Input model for querying Yu-Gi-Oh! card information with various filters.\n\nAttributes:\n    name (Optional[str]): Filter by exact card name.\n    fname (Optional[str]): Fuzzy search by name fragment.\n    archetype (Optional[str]): Filter by card archetype.\n    attribute (Optional[str]): Filter by card attribute (DARK, LIGHT, etc).\n    race (Optional[str]): Filter by card race/type (Warrior, Dragon, etc).\n    level (Optional[int]): Filter by card level or rank.\n    cardset (Optional[str]): Filter by card set name.\n    format (Optional[str]): Filter by card format (TCG, OCG, Speed Duel, etc).\n    misc (Optional[bool]): Include additional metadata in the response.",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "name": {
      "title": "Name",
      "description": "Exact card name",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "fname": {
      "title": "Fname",
      "description": "Fuzzy search by name fragment",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "archetype": {
      "title": "Archetype",
      "description": "Card archetype, e.g. Blue-Eyes",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "attribute": {
      "title": "Attribute",
      "description": "Card attribute, e.g. DARK, LIGHT",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "race": {
      "title": "Race",
      "description": "Card race/type, e.g. Warrior, Dragon",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "level": {
      "title": "Level",
      "description": "Level or rank of the card",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "cardset": {
      "title": "Cardset",
      "description": "Card set, e.g. Metal Raiders",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "format": {
      "title": "Format",
      "description": "Card format, e.g. TCG, Speed Duel",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "misc": {
      "title": "Misc",
      "description": "Whether to include additional metadata",
      "default": false,
      "type": "boolean"
    }
  }
}
```

## Usage as Tool
**Tool Name:** `get_yugioh_card_info`
**Description:** Retrieve detailed Yu-Gi-Oh! card info using name, archetype, attribute, level, etc.

